Dialogue: 10,0:02:10.84,0:02:14.84,Title,,0,0,0,,{=2}{\fad(440,400)\bord2\blur3\shad0\\c&H000000&\4c&HFFFFFF&\3c&HFFFFFF&\pos(1817.4,909.4)}United Front, Tenka, Soar
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.51,0:02:16.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got this!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.09,0:02:26.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice one, Commander!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.65,0:02:30.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boom!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.83,0:02:44.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm very disappointed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.19,0:02:49.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I waited patiently, yet only\Ntwo targets came out to play.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.67,0:02:51.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where are the rest of you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.81,0:02:53.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Two targets with myself included.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.47,0:02:56.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is he after the commanders?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.85,0:02:58.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This fight will be over.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.67,0:03:00.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the mere blink of an eye!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.21,0:03:12.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was the strength of their leader?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.91,0:03:16.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I expected more from those little pests.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.67,0:03:24.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you could stay still,\Nthat would be great.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.57,0:03:26.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You dare attempt to kick me?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.63,0:03:27.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How arrogant of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.01,0:03:30.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My flesh is as strong as steel.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.55,0:03:31.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now block this!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.59,0:03:34.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am invincible!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.95,0:03:47.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm hurt? Impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.13,0:03:49.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.71,0:03:52.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's taking on a humanoid.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.95,0:03:54.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lady 10 is very talented.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.11,0:03:57.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She can escape anything\Nbecause of her ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.01,0:04:00.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but she doesn't actually need to run away.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.87,0:04:05.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Both commanders came up with a plan to\Nwipe out an invading army in no time flat,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.13,0:04:06.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and they did it all in their heads!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.93,0:04:08.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh my god, Lady Ken!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.15,0:04:11.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lady Ken, you're so freaking hot!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.55,0:04:12.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh my god!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.31,0:04:15.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Grat!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.29,0:04:17.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.29,0:04:22.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, this time I'll simply have to...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.13,0:04:23.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,blow you to pieces!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.17,0:04:33.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good luck avoiding that one!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.75,0:04:36.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.91,0:04:37.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is she...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.99,0:04:39.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.67,0:04:41.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the end of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.97,0:04:46.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did he really think it was over?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.79,0:04:58.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She teleported me by tossing me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.17,0:05:06.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The perfect decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.25,0:05:12.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lady Ten has the godlike ability to\Nmanipulate space around her, aptly named...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.81,0:05:14.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ame no mitori.
Dialogue: 11,0:05:15.02,0:05:16.98,Signs - Style 2,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.8\fs150\c&HEAEAEA&\bord0\shad0\frz339\pos(1135.92,422.76)}AME-NO-MITORI
Dialogue: 10,0:05:15.02,0:05:16.98,Signs - Style 2,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.8\fs150\c&H000000&\bord0\shad0\frz339\pos(1149.96,428.88)}AME-NO-MITORI
Dialogue: 9,0:05:15.02,0:05:16.98,Signs - Style 2,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.8\fs200\c&H7A7A7A&\bord0\shad0\frz339\pos(1050.56,376.51)\iclip(m 1074.53 382.18 l 1078.18 386.43 1082.13 390.68 1086.38 394.94 1087.59 396.15 1088.81 393.42 1091.85 395.54 1093.97 397.37 1096.1 397.97 1098.84 400.41 1101.57 401.62 1104.61 402.53 1106.13 403.14 1108.86 404.66 1110.68 404.66 1113.11 404.66 1115.54 404.66 1117.97 403.44 1119.49 402.53 1120.41 400.41 1119.8 397.67 1118.58 396.76 1117.97 395.24 1117.06 393.11 1117.97 391.29 1118.89 390.08 1117.06 388.25 1116.46 385.22 1114.94 381.87 1111.9 380.35 1109.16 379.14 1107.65 378.53 1106.43 377.92 1104.3 376.41 1103.09 373.37 1103.39 370.63 1100.66 368.2 1100.05 366.68 1098.84 365.47 1097.01 363.95 1095.19 362.43 1093.37 360.91)}AME-NO-MITORI
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.29,0:05:35.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I rip apart the fabric of space,\Nyour defenses don't do you much good.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.41,0:05:39.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An entire swarm of Shuuki gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.49,0:05:42.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All of the commanders\Nare brilliant like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.97,0:05:45.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're obviously on a different level.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.71,0:05:49.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And Miss Kyoka wants to be the\NSupreme Commander in charge of them?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.27,0:05:52.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sounds like an awfully ambitious goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.09,0:05:59.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,True, but I'm going to be the\Nnext Supreme Commander in line.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.45,0:06:02.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess I don't have to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.15,0:06:05.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, hunt the\Nstragglers and take them out!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.69,0:06:06.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, ma 'am!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.85,0:06:11.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't just stand around\Ngawking at Miss Kyoka.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.91,0:06:15.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I made up my mind to be a hero in Mato!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.83,0:06:26.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We exterminated the Shuki army.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.99,0:06:30.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But according to Nei's report, there\Nwere other enemy generals present.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.99,0:06:32.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And yet there was no sign of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.93,0:06:36.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We searched as thorough as possible,\Nbut still came up empty-handed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.75,0:06:40.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe what happened is all of them\Ngot squashed in that big blast.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.31,0:06:41.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not so sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.91,0:06:43.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They were very peculiar.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.23,0:06:45.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.11,0:06:50.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even with the power of foresight,\NI detected the enemy too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.53,0:06:52.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, it happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.21,0:06:55.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They probably used some\Nsort of cloaking ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.89,0:06:58.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You detected them before\Nthey started attacking us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.69,0:07:02.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Meaning, you circumvented\Nany potential for an ambush.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.35,0:07:05.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You did your job well, so\Ndon't dwell on the negative.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.93,0:07:07.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Precisely. Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.03,0:07:12.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Little Slave, You really\Nstole the show out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.91,0:07:14.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I don't know about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.83,0:07:17.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were way more impressive\Nthan me, Miss Izumo.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.39,0:07:19.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr. Yuuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.81,0:07:22.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I witnessed your performance\Non the battlefield!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.33,0:07:25.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So now I know that boys can\Nbe talented sometimes too!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.39,0:07:27.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you don't mind, can\NI have your autograph?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.97,0:07:28.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.03,0:07:30.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see, now you've got a fan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.41,0:07:32.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.73,0:07:33.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.37,0:07:35.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,About earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.45,0:07:40.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you for saving my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.87,0:07:44.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, well, you are an Azuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.05,0:07:48.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I'd let the enemy defeat you, it\Nwould bring shame upon the family.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.03,0:07:50.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is the only reason why I saved you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.93,0:07:54.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course, if you're saying that you\Nfelt the weight of your own inadequacies.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.93,0:07:56.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd graciously train them out of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.99,0:07:58.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So come back home and.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.59,0:08:01.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The 7th Squadron is my home.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.97,0:08:07.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Writing up a report is\Ngoing to be a challenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.69,0:08:09.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As for the exhibition match...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.29,0:08:10.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.20,0:08:11.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suppose we'll call it a draw for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.93,0:08:12.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's unfortunate.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.07,0:08:15.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was really looking\Nforward to our one-on-one.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.67,0:08:16.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.77,0:08:19.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, we'll be heading out now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.51,0:08:20.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bye-bye, ladies!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.65,0:08:23.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.29,0:08:34.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm beat. I need\Na nice, refreshing bath.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.11,0:08:43.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this supposed to be my reward\Nweren't you the one who asked for this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.11,0:08:48.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So indecent well he did slay a\Nsubstantial number of Shuuki today.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.43,0:08:50.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Miss Kyouka, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.15,0:08:53.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I get both at the same time?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.43,0:08:55.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the price of my ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.49,0:08:56.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Every single time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.07,0:08:59.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yet I'm always surprised. Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.89,0:09:04.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's going to get in\Nthe hot spring with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.45,0:09:06.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Freaking pervert.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.85,0:09:08.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take off your damn clothes!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.63,0:09:09.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, uh, yes ma 'am!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.77,0:09:21.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wasn't exactly sure what to\Nexpect when we stripped down naked,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.25,0:09:23.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but evidently he wanted a good scrap down.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.79,0:09:27.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just thought it would be kind\Nof nice to freshen up a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.11,0:09:29.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, it's basically the\Nsame thing as bathing a dog,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.49,0:09:31.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so there's no reason to be embarrassed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.25,0:09:34.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't understand anything you\Nsay when you talk that fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.33,0:09:39.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yuki, your body is more\Ntired than usual, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.55,0:09:41.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mm, it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.37,0:09:43.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Two masters at once took a lot out of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.13,0:09:47.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So it makes you strong, but\Nit's not to be used lightly.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.53,0:09:48.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.44,0:09:51.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We learned to utilize the\Nskill in a practical way,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.11,0:09:55.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and we'll need to continue to explore\Nits possibilities in the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.53,0:09:59.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But for the time being,\Nyou should get some rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.43,0:10:02.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The dorm's hot spring is\Ngreat for curing fatigue.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.93,0:10:14.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The lens naysaw!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.75,0:10:15.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.53,0:10:20.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's amazing as always!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.87,0:10:22.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My magnum opus!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.93,0:10:26.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure, it's good, but the\Nart style is kind of...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.61,0:10:30.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They'll make an official\Ncomposite sketch at HQ later.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.55,0:10:35.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Neither of them are the humanoid\Nwe encountered last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.41,0:10:52.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The one that looks like my sister?\NHow come she wasn't with them?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.29,0:10:54.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe they're a different squad
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.63,0:10:59.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,or is there some other reason?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.01,0:11:09.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
