Dialogue: 16,0:11:19.05,0:11:22.06,Signs,,0,0,0,,{=14}{\blur1.5\fscy120\fs100\fn123Marker\frz4.426\pos(623.69,570.98)}{\an7\c&H5F5D62&}Yuuki Wakura
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.77,0:11:38.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So this is the Sixth Squadron's dorm.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.27,0:11:42.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All of the dormitories look\Nidentical on the outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.21,0:11:45.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I noticed that when we\Nvisited the Fifth Squadron.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.17,0:11:46.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For the most part, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.05,0:11:49.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Though the interiors\Ntend to differ slightly.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.21,0:11:53.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Welcome to the Sixth Squadron dorm.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.49,0:11:54.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for making the trek.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.07,0:11:57.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A little change of scenery never hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.35,0:12:00.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did he run into any\Ntrouble on your way over?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.01,0:12:03.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Took down some Shuki in\Nroute, but that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.71,0:12:05.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was business as usual in Mato.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.93,0:12:10.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tenka and I need to have a meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.87,0:12:12.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For now, these are my orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.15,0:12:15.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get properly acquainted\Nwith the Sixth Squadron.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.49,0:12:19.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A few members went out on an\Nexpedition, so they won't be joining us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.27,0:12:21.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the rest of the girls\Nare still here in the dorm,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.71,0:12:23.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so feel free to take a look around.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.67,0:12:24.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.58,0:12:27.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And Yuuki, as we discussed\Nthis morning... Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.65,0:12:31.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As the 7th Squad's caretaker, I\Nwill help out in any way I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.19,0:12:35.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, our caretaker\Nisn't available at the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.09,0:12:37.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just until they return this evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.31,0:12:38.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My apologies.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.57,0:12:39.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.75,0:12:42.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As part of the Demon Defense Force,\Nwe've got to have each other's backs.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.95,0:12:43.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't you agree?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.87,0:12:44.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.78,0:12:46.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be counting on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.19,0:12:48.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.51,0:12:50.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.42,0:12:51.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leave it to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.53,0:12:57.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, first things first, cleaning.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.35,0:13:01.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or it would be.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.83,0:13:04.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But this place is pretty clean already.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.53,0:13:08.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And here I was getting all amped up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.73,0:13:10.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hm? Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.61,0:13:12.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This stain.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.97,0:13:15.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Judging by the feel of it,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.61,0:13:19.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Formula 5 might work better\Nthan just plain old baking soda.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.19,0:13:21.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm, or maybe...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.77,0:13:23.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So many choices!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.37,0:13:25.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Next up is laundry!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.75,0:13:33.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Breathe.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.66,0:13:34.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just breathe.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.03,0:13:37.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You do the 7th Squad's\Nlaundry all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.01,0:13:40.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.47,0:13:42.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm still not used to it.
