Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.95,0:13:47.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder what Yuki is up to right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.51,0:13:51.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh man, I wish I could have gone with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.03,0:13:59.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told myself I'd get him to like me more.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.79,0:14:03.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If anything, I should be using\Nthis time for self-improvement.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.09,0:14:08.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess I'll start by tidying up.
