Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.05,0:14:15.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Himari's big sister's room.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.27,0:14:23.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder what she'll say when she sees me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.85,0:14:27.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyone home?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.89,0:14:31.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.73,0:14:35.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.21,0:14:38.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess I'll just leave this in her room.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.99,0:14:39.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pardon me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.51,0:15:10.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.97,0:15:11.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sahara Wakasa?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.57,0:15:14.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why is she asleep in the living room?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.29,0:15:17.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And in her underwear no less.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.93,0:15:22.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't let her catch\Na cold, so I'll just...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.21,0:15:32.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does she think I'm her pillow?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.97,0:15:37.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to bail before someone sees me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.45,0:15:42.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, no, you're not going anyway. Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.69,0:15:47.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the girl who wrestled like\Na pro in the exhibition match.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.33,0:15:49.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Either way, I've got to get free.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.09,0:15:51.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now behave yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.17,0:15:59.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And though I wished for\Nescape, I was unable to escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.23,0:16:04.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, eventually, I stopped\Nthinking and gave in.
