Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.77,0:16:08.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aw, sorry, my bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.41,0:16:14.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I completely forgot the 7th Squadron\Nwas supposed to come visit today. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.03,0:16:15.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.79,0:16:19.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Himari, what's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.75,0:16:22.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm waiting until she's\Ndone to speak to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.47,0:16:42.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does Yachiho do this regularly? Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.73,0:16:45.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She trained like that before\Nthe exhibition match, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.09,0:16:48.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's pushing herself\Neven harder nowadays.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.03,0:16:52.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, do you look up to Yacchi?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.71,0:16:55.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, since she's\Nyour big sister and all.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.39,0:17:01.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Her personality is terrible, but she's\Nsuccessful academically and athletically.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.05,0:17:05.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've always thought I could\Nlearn a thing or two from her.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.99,0:17:06.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Personally,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.90,0:17:09.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a fan of the theory that\Nsomeone's Peach ability is
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.93,0:17:13.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,based on their human nature\Nand knowledge they've acquired.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.27,0:17:14.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So in your case,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.81,0:17:19.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,your desire to learn from Yachi\Nis what became your ability!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.63,0:17:22.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the same goes for Yachi's\Nskill to control time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.93,0:17:26.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It stems from her desire to spend\Ntime with her little sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.73,0:17:28.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Makes sense, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.63,0:17:29.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.29,0:17:32.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think that you are making\Na lot of assumptions.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.05,0:17:37.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aw, but it might be nice if you talk\Nto her a little more often, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.25,0:17:39.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.41,0:17:41.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your big sister's cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.91,0:17:48.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here I guess she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.07,0:18:09.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What can't hear you, you\Nneed to check your attitude!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.35,0:18:13.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a relief looks like they're\Ngetting along better already? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.99,0:18:14.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Though,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.90,0:18:19.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suppose showing her Yachi's room would\Nbe the most efficient way to solve this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.49,0:18:22.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perhaps it would be best\Nto keep that part a secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.69,0:18:25.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Track down the humanoid Shuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.01,0:18:26.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.45,0:18:31.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've seen no movement from the\Nhumanoid since this latest attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.01,0:18:35.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So instead of waiting around, I\Nthink we should make the first move.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.95,0:18:37.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, good point.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.43,0:18:38.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That large crater.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.71,0:18:40.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My team encountered a\Nvast group of Shuki there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.05,0:18:43.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's also where we first\Nengaged a humanoid.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.45,0:18:45.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's where we should\Nstart our investigation.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.77,0:18:46.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.68,0:18:48.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't have any issues with that call.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.51,0:18:49.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm curious.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.49,0:18:52.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How many more of these\Nthings do you think exist?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.29,0:18:54.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've confirmed a total of four so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.51,0:18:58.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you already eliminated\None of those four humanoids.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.03,0:19:00.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not certain.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.59,0:19:05.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To be honest with you, I didn't get the\Nfeeling that we truly defeated that being.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.95,0:19:28.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Glad to see you've made\Na full recovery, Rairen.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.55,0:19:33.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seriously, that was a\Nvery close encounter.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.45,0:19:51.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's a good thing you have me i\Ncould have kept fighting after that
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.29,0:19:58.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the battle was lost when you let them\Nraise your army to the ground i agree
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.61,0:20:02.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With Shikoku's assessment, let us review.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.35,0:20:05.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,shall we in order to evaluate the enemy's
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.93,0:20:10.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,capabilities i fought the third squadron\Nit was a piece of cake but their
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.31,0:20:14.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,commander wasn't with them at the time so\Nthe purpose of this recent endeavor was to
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.07,0:20:19.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,experience the commander's strength\Nfirsthand but they blew my expectations out
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.57,0:20:25.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of the water it appears that your plan to\Nuse our resources and launch a full-scale
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.37,0:20:30.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,attack on the defense force was trash\Nwait just a second they may be a tough
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.59,0:20:32.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,organization but I know they can be beaten
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.89,0:20:37.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,which one of us do you think\Nis right Jouryuu. Shikoku.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.73,0:20:39.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.33,0:20:43.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that that's settled, we're\Ngoing with my plan this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.95,0:20:47.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We will launch an attack once\Nwe've gathered all eight people.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.55,0:20:49.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Until then, we operate from the shadows.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.03,0:20:53.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The eight of us will be\Ntogether soon enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.91,0:20:54.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.07,0:20:59.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, I hate it when you\Nuse the phrase eight people!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.61,0:21:01.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are not filthy humans!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.45,0:21:03.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't degrade us like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.25,0:21:05.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.17,0:21:09.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shikoku, you're interested\Nin the humans, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.99,0:21:12.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Humans are fascinating creatures.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.53,0:21:15.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You might say they're more\Ncomplex than I imagined.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.25,0:21:18.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just can't get enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.75,0:21:21.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suppose that concludes today's meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.79,0:21:24.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you have anything else?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.15,0:21:27.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just one thing regarding personnel.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.83,0:21:28.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.35,0:21:34.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Little Slave, do you mind if I keep him?
